flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Admin configures versioned criteria and weights]
    B --> C[Reviewer uploads proposals and selects category]
    C --> D[AI extracts facts with evidence into fixed JSON]
    D --> E[Code validates schema, types and evidence]
    E -->|Invalid| F[Bounded retry; unresolved output goes to human review]
    F --> G[Rule-based mandatory checks]
    E -->|Valid| G
    G --> H{Mandatory checks}
    H -->|Confirmed failure| I[INELIGIBLE]
    H -->|Unresolved| J[FLAGGED]
    H -->|All pass| K{Material weighted evidence missing?}
    K -->|Yes| L[FLAGGED; rank null]
    K -->|No| M[Deterministic criterion scores and weighted total]
    M --> N[Rank eligible proposals; deterministic tie-break]
    I --> O[Human review, resolve or override with written reason]
    J --> O
    L --> O
    N --> O
    O --> P[Save ranking.json and complete audit record]
    D -. Embedded instructions .-> Q[Ignore as untrusted input and log]
    Q -.-> E
    B -. Criteria edited later .-> R[New version; explicitly rescore full batch]
    R -.-> G
